      "kind": "WritingExerciseSentence",
      "values": {
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "VietnameseText": "B\u00E1o c\u00E1o n\u00E0y m\u00F4 t\u1EA3 chuy\u1EBFn th\u0103m v\u01B0\u1EDDn rau c\u1EE7a m\u1ED9t l\u1EDBp h\u1ECDc gi\u1EA3 \u0111\u1ECBnh.",
