        "SortOrder": 6,
        "VietnameseText": "M\u1ED9t nh\u00F3m qu\u00EAn mang b\u00FAt n\u00EAn ph\u1EA3i m\u01B0\u1EE3n nh\u00F3m kh\u00E1c.",
